add('issueFab|myIssues|issuesBack|issueUpdates','Open application issue reporting or your submitted issue history. The floating Report Issue button is hidden while its dialog is open so it cannot cover Send Issue Report. Close the dialog to return to the page. Use this for a PhotoNotes software problem. Describe the exact screen, action, expected result, and actual result; road/property records are separate workflows.',['App issue']);
