add('data-pair-complete','This document contains only one member of a saved Before/After pair. Add Missing Before Photo or Add Missing After Photo adds its paired photograph to this document after your click. Regenerate the PDF or Word export to include the complete pair. Existing downloads and sent snapshots do not update automatically.',['Before/after','Document']);
