add('testingAllIssues','Open the complete Issue Management Center to monitor all testers, open reports, closed reports, retest instructions, replies and investigation history. Testing managers have monitoring access; owner decisions and repair changes remain with the Super Admin. Outstanding retests receive in-app reminders every four hours for the tester and active testing managers until a result is submitted. Enabled browser notifications receive them too. Email copies require a configured email service. New retest and clarification requests send an initial email immediately to the reporter and active testing managers; additional retest emails follow the schedule saved by the Super Admin in Email Notification Settings and can be switched off. In-app reminders stay every four hours.',['App issue','Retest']);
